* >Natural Source Header 000000
* :Mode S
* :CP
* :LineIncrement 10
* <Natural Source Header
* RMSTOREP - Store open Active Report
*
* Maintenance:
* uuu yy-mm-dd s(999999) ....
* mrs 93-01-12 s(999999) clean up
* mrs 93-01-12 s(999999) fill fields ar-desc and ar-printers even if a
*                        definition exists
* mrs 93-12-23 s(999999) fill distribution list from report definition
* mrs 94-11-08 s(211501) create/distribute connect doc error if
*                        active report is reopened
* mrs 95-11-27 s(999999) extended spool attributes
* gw  96-10-15 s(255654) message 'report opened' instead of 'created'
* gw  98-06-24 p(171848) revive retention ignored
* gw  98-07-06 p(172117) master repname for access to 'PUBLIC' reports
*                        in RLISBC
* gw  98-07-16 p(172297) recat for build list active bundle redesign
*                        to include prerequisites
* gw  98-07-21 p(172407) allow report generations for retention
* jvd 99-11-17 p(188923) Rcompiled due to changed MONITNGL
*                        removed comments pre 1997
* sju 00-03-27 p(191368) monitor multitasking
* wcd 00-04-01 CE 7267  Increase to 20 printers
* xsiszha 2000-08-15 (CE7461) Extend Report and Bundle Names
* HH 040825 FORMATTING T CHANGED;                /* HH 040825
* sju 04-12-06 NOM31     Add date and time (tenths of second) to trace
* xsetggr 2005-10-26 p(270950) Field G-ACTIVE-ISN must be P10, not P8
* fhi     2007-03-16 FHI213    Call NOMEX013 before opening report
* xsetggr 2007-04-24           assign value for AR-HOLD-PRINT
* xsetggr 2007-07-13 NOM3201   Support P11 format run numbers
* xsetggr 2007-07-19 p(295731) support printing default separator if
*                              separator member omitted.
* xsetggr 2008-02-15 p(301552) mark using nomex013
* xsetggr 2008-04-09 p(303829) accept changes done by nomex013
* fhi     2009-05-19 N3463     Extend metadata for OPO, 'ACTIVE-REPORTS'
*                              changed to 'ACTIVE-REPRTS'
* xsetggr 2009-11-10 N3460     fill AR-SOURCE, AR-SENDER fields
* fhi     2010-10-08 NOMALL-97 Use dynamic memory handling
* fhi     2010-10-12 NOMALL-97 Use trace levels, use XXRLOG
* xsetggr 2011-08-05 NOMALL1-1047 enlarge source/sender length up to 20
* xsetggr 2011-09-14 NOMALL-1051  prevent NAT1326
* xsetggr 2011-10-17 NOMALL-970 implement report flag 'Print o6ce'
* xsetggr 2011-12-12 NOMALL-1076 corrections to prevent NAT1327
* raya    2012-08-15 NOMALL-78   disable long records
* fhi     2012-08-20 NOMALL-1004 Add report formatting parameters
* raya    2012-11-29 NOMALL-1214 check cat date of nomex*
* xsetggr 2013-01-22 NOMALL-970 implementation cancelled
* raya    2013-05-12 NOMALL-1214 backout check cat date of nomex*
* fhi     2013-06-04 OPO-36    Fill field AR-ACTIVE
* raya    2013-09-10 NOMALL-932 use dynamic instead of array
* fhi     2014-03-03 NOMALL-1363 Get cat cate into trace messages
* fhi     2014-03-19 NATOS-6387  Avoid AIVs for ext subroutine call
* SU1     2014-07-21 NOMALL-1279 fill fields for Adabas Vista
* fhi     2014-10-21 NOMALL-79   Introduce long filenames
* CF1     2015-07-08 NOMALL-1669 Set unique log types
* SU2     2015-08-11 NOMALL-1690 XXHASH restructure
* fhi     2015-11-06 NOMALL-1772 Backout domain handling, done by OPO
* SU3     2015-12-30 NOMALL-1722 support long path names
* fhi     2016-08-01 NOMALL-1748 Backout Report Formatting
* fhi     2017-01-11 NOMALL-1916 Show node in msg 7016
* fhi     2017-03-31 NOMALL-2009 Improve RDC handling
* SU4     2018-01-29 NOMALL-1823 NOM 3.5: remove CONNECT
* SU5     2018-08-30 NOMALL-2130 sep.var.:GDA MONIT-GL -> PDA RMEXSEPA
* SU6     2018-10-18             LDA MONITNGL removed
* fhi     2018-11-09 NOMALL-1916 Add code page after msg 7016
* SU7     2019-01-16 NOMALL-2085 NOM35 printer:sep.pages: AR
* BLI     2020-03-05 NOMALL-2294 Reset +G-ACTIVE-ISN-P10 to prevent 3113
* BLI2    2020-06-10 NOMALL-2416 Correct/Enhance NOMEX013 parameters
* SU8     2020-11-10 NOMALL-2440 split DDM -> NRM-MF-NODES
* SU9     2024-03-07 ES-34613    NOM 3.6 Remove power
* ----------------------------------------------------------------------
DEFINE DATA GLOBAL USING MONIT-GL
PARAMETER USING RMEXSEPA /*SU5
************************************************************************
INDEPENDENT
1 +G-SPOOL-ATTR-EXTENDED (A) DYNAMIC
1 +G-ACTIVE-ISN-P10      (P10)
1 +G-NOMEXIT-ACTIVE      (L/1:20)
1 +NOD-LOCAL-NAME        (A16)
1 +NOD-LOCAL-CODEPAGE    (A64)
1 +CMRDC                 (A1)
* *****
LOCAL USING CONST-L
LOCAL USING RLOG-L
/*SU6 LOCAL USING MONITNGL
LOCAL USING RMSR---E
LOCAL USING XXHASH-P
LOCAL USING RMSPL--L
/*SU8 LOCAL USING VMONITUL
* *****
LOCAL
1 MF-NODE VIEW OF NRM-MF-NODES /*SU8
  2 MF-MONITOR-ID (A20)  /* identify the NR
  2 MF-MONITOR-NODE (N5.0)  /* The natural pro
1 REPORT-ATTR VIEW OF NRM-REPORTS-NEW
  2 R-REVIVE-RETENTION
1 ACT-REP VIEW OF NRM-ACTIVE-REPORTS
  2 AR-MASTER-REPNAME
