  2 AR-ARCHIVE-VOLSER                 (1:2)
  2 AR-REVIVE
  2 AR-REVIVE-EXPIRATION
  2 AR-REVIVE-DATE
  2 AR-REVIVE-RETENTION-PERIOD
  2 REDEFINE AR-REVIVE-RETENTION-PERIOD
    3 AR-REVIVE-RETENTION-NUM         (N3)
    3 AR-REVIVE-RETENTION-UNIT        (A1)
    3 AR-REVIVE-RETENTION-CALENDAR    (A8)
  2 AR-CHARS
  2 AR-DATASET-IDENTIFIER
